title: "SWATI: Surface Water Availability-Temperature Index (Google Earth Engine implementation)"
abstract: "Google Earth Engine implementation of the Surface Water Availability-Temperature Index (SWATI) for generating near-global monthly dryness-wetness maps at 1 km resolution from MODIS NDVI, NDLI, and LST."
